{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《愛．回家之三代同糖》演員李茵彤（Desta）、胡敏芝、侯雋熙及廖家爵因拍劇結成好友。日前 Desta 在社交平台大晒一組鏡頭背後的花絮照，與粉絲分享劇組的日常點滴。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bac2031f-1da1-4cbf-9fff-55022a07.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20266bMQZ3WBUK1787912463.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bac2031f-1da1-4cbf-9fff-55022a07.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，四人在旅遊巴上吃飯盒、又在樓梯間開心打卡，展現出劇組融洽歡樂的氣氛。由於拍攝行程極為緊密，Desta 更公開自己與胡敏芝在旅遊巴上累倒「斷電」熟睡的照片，真實展現演員背後的辛酸。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a3f1042f-a21e-4355-8db5-4b3c4a07.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026LllCBd7XcK1787912485.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a3f1042f-a21e-4355-8db5-4b3c4a07.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">照片曝光後，吸引大批網民圍觀，不少網民大讚「隔着個 Mon 都感受到他們感情極好」，亦有網民感嘆做演員確實不容易，紛紛留言為他們加油打氣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T02:58:19.960080+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}